{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"cudagraph-update-reuse","content_sha256":"sha256:815604bb256a4f01d77663e73861f520feedec723519c2932513a1dfb2adbe78","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789953949.128333,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"复用图:固定静态输入缓冲(拷进同一地址)或用 graph exec update 只更新变化参数,避免重捕获;decode 用图时分桶+静态缓冲即此道理。","id":"q-op-cudagraph-update-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"用固定的静态输入缓冲区(每步把新数据拷进同一地址)让图的指针不变,或用 cudaGraphExecUpdate/图参数更新只改变化的节点参数而复用已实例化的图,避免昂贵的重新捕获;这也是 decode 用图时对可变 batch 分桶+静态缓冲的原因"},{"id":"b","text":"每步都必须完全重新捕获整张图"},{"id":"c","text":"CUDA graph 不能复用"},{"id":"d","text":"改地址不影响图重放"}],"prompt":"已捕获的 CUDA graph 若每步输入张量地址/少量参数会变,如何避免反复重新捕获?","review_state":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"engineering","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"CUDA graph update","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/index.html#cuda-graphs"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"cuda-performance","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
